#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:1
msgid "Module Configuration"
msgstr "模块配置"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:3
msgid ""
"moon uses a module file to identify and describe a module. The legacy "
"format is `moon.mod.json`,  and the new format is `moon.mod`. For full "
"JSON schema, please check [moon's "
"repository](https://github.com/moonbitlang/moon/blob/main/crates/moonbuild/template/mod.schema.json)."
msgstr ""
"moon 使用模块文件来标识和描述一个模块。旧格式为 `moon.mod.json`，新格式为 `moon.mod`。完整的 JSON 模式请查看"
" [moon "
"的仓库](https://github.com/moonbitlang/moon/blob/main/crates/moonbuild/template/mod.schema.json)。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:6
msgid ""
"Support for `moon.mod.json` is deprecated. Prefer `moon.mod` for new "
"projects and migrate existing JSON files with `moon fmt`."
msgstr "对 `moon.mod.json` 的支持已弃用。新项目应优先使用 `moon.mod`，并通过 `moon fmt` 迁移现有 JSON 文件。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:10
msgid "Full syntax of moon.mod is as follows:"
msgstr "`moon.mod` 的完整语法如下："

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:12
msgid ""
"moon_mod ::= statement*\n"
"statement ::= import | assign | apply\n"
"\n"
"import ::= \"import\" \"{\" (import_item \",\")* import_item? \"}\" "
"import_kind?\n"
"import_item ::= STRING\n"
"\n"
"assign ::= LIDENT \"=\" expr\n"
"\n"
"apply ::= LIDENT \"(\" (argument \",\")* argument? \")\"\n"
"argument ::= LIDENT \":\" expr | STRING \":\" expr  \n"
"\n"
"expr ::= array | object | apply | STRING | INT | \"true\" | \"false\"\n"
"array ::= \"[\" (expr \",\")* expr? \"]\"\n"
"object ::= \"{\" (field \",\")* field? \"}\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:30
msgid "Name"
msgstr "名称"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:32
msgid ""
"The `name` field is used to specify the name of the module, and it is "
"required."
msgstr "`name` 字段用于指定模块的名称，它是必需的。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md
msgid "moon.mod"
msgstr "moon.mod"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:36
msgid "name = \"user/example\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md
msgid "moon.mod.json"
msgstr "moon.mod.json"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:42
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"name\": \"user/example\"\n"
"  // ...\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:51
msgid "The module name can contain letters, numbers, `_`, `-`, and `/`."
msgstr "模块名称可以包含字母、数字、`_`、`-` 和 `/`。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:53
msgid ""
"For modules published to [mooncakes.io](https://mooncakes.io), the module"
" name must begin with the username."
msgstr "对于发布到 [mooncakes.io](https://mooncakes.io) 的模块，模块名称必须以用户名开头。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:55
msgid "Version"
msgstr "版本"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:57
msgid "The `version` field is used to specify the version of the module."
msgstr " `version` 字段用于指定模块的版本。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:59
msgid ""
"This field is optional. For modules published to "
"[mooncakes.io](https://mooncakes.io), the version number must follow the "
"[Semantic Versioning 2.0.0](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html) "
"specification."
msgstr ""
"此字段是可选的。对于发布到 [mooncakes.io](https://mooncakes.io) 的模块，版本号必须遵循 [语义化版本 "
"2.0.0](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html) 规范。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:63
msgid "version = \"0.1.0\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:68
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"version\": \"0.1.0\"\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:76
msgid "Dependency Management"
msgstr "依赖管理"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:78
msgid ""
"Module dependencies are declared with `import` in `moon.mod`. The legacy "
"`moon.mod.json` format represents the same information in its `deps` "
"field."
msgstr ""
"模块依赖通过 `moon.mod` 中的 `import` 声明。遗留的 `moon.mod.json` 格式则使用 `deps` "
"字段表示相同信息。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:81
msgid "It is automatically managed by commands like `moon add` and `moon remove`."
msgstr "它由 `moon add` 和 `moon remove` 等命令自动管理。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:85
msgid ""
"name = \"username/hello\"\n"
"import {\n"
"  \"moonbitlang/x@0.4.6\"\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:93
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"name\": \"username/hello\",\n"
"  \"deps\": {\n"
"    \"moonbitlang/x\": \"0.4.6\"\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:104
msgid "You may also use a local dependency for module."
msgstr "你也可以为模块使用本地依赖。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:108
msgid ""
"For new `moon.mod` format, the local dependency configuration is "
"deprecated.  The recommended way to use a local dependency is to "
"configure it in `moon.work`."
msgstr "对于新的 `moon.mod` 格式，本地依赖配置已被弃用。推荐的本地依赖使用方式是在 `moon.work` 中配置。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:111
msgid ""
"For example, if you use `moon.work` to manage `user/module1` and "
"`user/module2`:"
msgstr "例如，如果你使用 `moon.work` 管理 `user/module1` 和 `user/module2`："

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:113
msgid ""
"// in moon.work\n"
"members = [\n"
"  \"source/to/module1\",\n"
"  \"source/to/module2\",\n"
"]\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:121
msgid "And `user/module1` uses `user/module2` as a dependency:"
msgstr "并且 `user/module1` 使用 `user/module2` 作为依赖："

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:123
msgid ""
"// in source/to/module1/moon.mod\n"
"import {\n"
"  \"user/module2@0.1.0\"\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:130
msgid ""
"The `@version` part is ignored, `user/module2` is resolved from the local"
" source instead of mooncakes.io."
msgstr "`@version` 部分会被忽略，`user/module2` 会从本地源码解析，而不是从 mooncakes.io 解析。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:134
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"name\": \"username/hello\",\n"
"  \"deps\": {\n"
"    \"username/other\": {\n"
"      \"path\": \"../other\"\n"
"    }\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:147
msgid "Meta Information"
msgstr "元信息"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:149
