"{\n"
"  \"readme\": \"README.md\"\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:169
msgid "Repository"
msgstr "仓库"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:171
msgid ""
"The `repository` field is used to specify the URL of the module's "
"repository."
msgstr "`repository` 字段用于指定模块的仓库的 URL。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:175
msgid "repository = \"link/to/your/repo\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:180
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"repository\": \"link/to/your/repo\"\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:189
msgid "License"
msgstr "许可证"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:191
msgid ""
"The `license` field is used to specify the license of the module. The "
"license type must comply with the [SPDX License "
"List](https://spdx.org/licenses/)."
msgstr "`license` 字段用于指定模块的许可证。许可证类型必须符合 [SPDX 许可证列表](https://spdx.org/licenses/)。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:196
msgid "license = \"MIT\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:201
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"license\": \"MIT\"\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:209
msgid "Keywords"
msgstr "关键字"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:211
msgid "The `keywords` field is used to specify the keywords for the module."
msgstr "`keywords` 字段用于指定模块的关键字。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:215
msgid "keywords = [\"example\", \"test\"]\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:220
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"keywords\": [\"example\", \"test\"]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:228
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:230
msgid "The `description` field is used to specify the description of the module."
msgstr "`description` 字段用于指定模块的描述。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:235
msgid "description = \"This is a description of the module.\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:240
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"description\": \"This is a description of the module.\"\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:248
msgid "Publishing Files with `.moonignore`"
msgstr "使用 `.moonignore` 控制发布文件"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:250
msgid ""
"Use `.moonignore` files to exclude files and directories from archives "
"created by `moon package` and `moon publish`. Each file uses gitignore-"
"style patterns:"
msgstr "使用 `.moonignore` 文件从 `moon package` 和 `moon publish` 创建的归档中排除文件和目录。每个文件使用 gitignore 风格的模式："

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:253
msgid ""
"# Generated output\n"
"build/\n"
"*.log\n"
"\n"
"# Keep this fixture even though other log files are excluded\n"
"!fixtures/expected.log\n"
"\n"
"# Keep selected root dotfiles that are excluded by default\n"
"!/.gitignore\n"
"!/.moonignore\n"
"\n"
"# Keep a hidden directory and everything below it\n"
"!/.well-known/\n"
"!/.well-known/**\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:270
msgid ""
"Publishing honors `.gitignore` rules by default. If a directory contains "
"a `.moonignore`, its rules are used instead of that directory's "
"`.gitignore` when creating the archive; the two files in the same "
"directory are not combined. This filtering is based on the patterns, "
"regardless of whether a file is tracked by Git."
msgstr ""
"发布时默认遵循 `.gitignore` 规则。如果某个目录包含 `.moonignore`，创建归档时将使用其规则代替同一目录中的 `.gitignore`；同一目录中的这两个文件不会合并。无论文件是否由 Git 跟踪，筛选都只依据这些模式。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:276
msgid ""
"Git's repository-local `.git/info/exclude` and global ignore "
"configuration are not consulted. Only the ignore files that belong to the"
" project affect the archive, so publishing the same contents does not "
"depend on a user's Git configuration."
msgstr "不会读取 Git 仓库本地的 `.git/info/exclude` 和全局忽略配置。只有项目自身包含的忽略文件会影响归档，因此发布相同内容的结果不会依赖用户的 Git 配置。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:281
msgid ""
"By default, files and directories whose names begin with `.` are excluded"
" at every depth. The root-anchored examples above keep the two ignore "
"files and `.well-known/` in the archive. Re-including a directory does "
"not automatically re-include its contents, so the second `.well-known` "
"rule is also needed."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，各层级中名称以 `.` 开头的文件和目录都会被排除。上面锚定到根目录的示例会将两个忽略文件和 `.well-known/` "
"保留在归档中。重新包含一个目录并不会自动重新包含其内容，因此还需要第二条 `.well-known` 规则。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:286
msgid ""
"The package-root `_build/` directory is always excluded and cannot be re-"
"included by an ignore rule or the deprecated `include` field. This fixed "
"exclusion does not apply to nested directories with the same name. For "
"example, `!/_build/` and `!/_build/**` cannot restore the package-root "
"directory, while `examples/_build/data.bin` is not excluded merely "
"because a nested directory is named `_build`."
msgstr ""
"包根目录下的 `_build/` 始终会被排除，无法通过忽略规则或已弃用的 `include` 字段重新包含。此固定排除不适用于同名的嵌套目录。例如，`!/_build/` 和 "
"`!/_build/**` 无法恢复包根目录下的 `_build/`，而 `examples/_build/data.bin` 不会仅仅因为所在的嵌套目录名为 `_build` 就被排除。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:293
msgid ""
"Rules apply to the directory containing the ignore file and all of its "
"descendants. Rules inherited from parent directories remain in effect, "
"while later matching rules in nested directories take precedence. This "
"includes `!` rules that restore a previously excluded path whose parent "
"directory is still visible. A leading `/` anchors a pattern to the "
"directory containing the ignore file, while a trailing `/` matches "
"directories."
msgstr ""
"规则作用于包含忽略文件的目录及其所有后代。父目录继承来的规则仍然有效，而嵌套目录中后出现的匹配规则优先。这也包括用 `!` "
"恢复先前排除的路径、且该路径的父目录仍然可见的规则。开头的 `/` 将模式锚定到包含忽略文件的目录，末尾的 `/` 则匹配目录。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:300
msgid ""
"Use [`moon package --list`](commands.md#moon-package) to inspect the "
"files that will be packaged."
msgstr "使用 [`moon package --list`](commands.md#moon-package) 检查将要打包的文件。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:303
msgid "Deprecated `include` and `exclude` fields"
msgstr "已弃用的 `include` 和 `exclude` 字段"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:306
msgid ""
"The `include` and `exclude` fields in `moon.mod` and `moon.mod.json` are "
"deprecated. Use `.moonignore` for new and migrated modules."
msgstr "`moon.mod` 和 `moon.mod.json` 中的 `include` 与 `exclude` 字段已弃用。新模块和迁移后的模块请使用 `.moonignore`。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:310
msgid ""
"Existing manifests may still use either field. When `include` is present,"
" it is an exhaustive allowlist: `exclude`, `.gitignore`, `.moonignore`, "
"and the default dot-prefixed-path exclusion are not applied. Use `!` "
"patterns within `include` for exceptions to the allowlist. The fixed "
"exclusion of the package-root `_build/` directory still applies."
msgstr ""
"现有清单仍可使用其中任一字段。当存在 `include` 时，它是完整的允许列表：不会应用 `exclude`、`.gitignore`、`.moonignore` "
"以及默认的点前缀路径排除规则。可在 `include` 中使用 `!` 模式为允许列表添加例外。对包根目录 `_build/` 的固定排除仍然有效。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:316
msgid ""
"Avoid combining these legacy fields with ignore files; migrate the "
"complete publishing policy to `.moonignore` instead."
msgstr "请勿将这些旧字段与忽略文件混用；应将完整的发布策略迁移到 `.moonignore`。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:319
msgid "Preferred Target"
msgstr "首选目标"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:321
msgid ""
"The `preferred_target` field allows `moon` and the language server to "
"know which target should be used as the default target, avoiding the "
"necessity to write `--target` when developing a project targeting other "
"backends than Wasm GC."
msgstr ""
"`preferred_target` 字段允许 `moon` 和语言服务器知道应该使用哪个目标作为默认目标，从而避免在开发针对 Wasm GC "
"以外的其他后端的项目时需要传递 `--target`。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:325
msgid ""
"Set `preferred_target` on each module. Workspace-level `preferred-target`"
" is deprecated; `moon run` uses the selected module's own preferred "
"target."
msgstr ""
"请在各模块中设置 `preferred_target`。工作区级别的 `preferred-target` 已弃用；`moon run` "
"使用所选模块自身的首选目标。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:331
msgid "preferred_target = \"js\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:336
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"preferred-target\": \"js\"\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"{\n"
"  \"preferred-target\": \"js\"\n"
"}\n"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:346
msgid "Supported Targets"
msgstr "支持的目标"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:348
msgid ""
"The `supported_targets` field declares which backends this module is "
"intended to support. Unlike `preferred_target`, it does not choose a "
"default target for commands. Use it to record the module's compatibility "
"surface in metadata."
msgstr ""
"`supported_targets` 字段用于声明该模块打算支持哪些后端。与 `preferred_target` "
"不同，它不会为命令选择默认目标。它的作用是把模块的兼容后端范围记录在元数据中。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:352
msgid "`supported_targets` uses a compact target-set syntax:"
msgstr "`supported_targets` 使用紧凑的目标集合语法："

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:354
msgid "`js` for a single backend"
msgstr "`js` 表示单个后端"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:355
msgid "`+js+wasm-gc` for an explicit set of backends"
msgstr "`+js+wasm-gc` 表示显式指定一组后端"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:356
msgid "`+all-js` for all backends except `js`"
msgstr "`+all-js` 表示除 `js` 之外的所有后端"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:358
msgid "For example:"
msgstr "例如："

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:362
msgid "supported_targets = \"+js+wasm-gc\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:367
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"supported-targets\": \"+js+wasm-gc\"\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"{\n"
"  \"supported-targets\": \"+js+wasm-gc\"\n"
"}\n"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:375
msgid "Legacy array syntax is still accepted for compatibility:"
msgstr "为了兼容，旧的数组语法仍然可以使用："

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:379
msgid "supported_targets = [\"js\", \"wasm-gc\"]\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:384
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"supported-targets\": [\"js\", \"wasm-gc\"]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:392
msgid "`preferred_target` and `supported_targets` are often used together:"
msgstr "`preferred_target` 和 `supported_targets` 经常一起使用："

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:394
msgid "`preferred_target` says which backend `moon` should use by default"
msgstr "`preferred_target` 表示 `moon` 默认应使用哪个后端"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:395
msgid "`supported_targets` says which backends the module claims to support"
msgstr "`supported_targets` 表示模块声明自己支持哪些后端"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:397
msgid ""
"When a package also defines `supported_targets`, the effective backend "
"set is the intersection of the module-level and package-level "
"declarations."
msgstr "当某个包也定义了 `supported_targets` 时，实际生效的后端集合就是模块级声明与包级声明的交集。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:400
msgid ""
"For per-file conditional compilation inside a package, use "
"[`targets`](package.md#conditional-compilation) in `moon.pkg` / "
"`moon.pkg.json` instead."
msgstr ""
"如果你想在包内部按文件做条件编译，应改用 `moon.pkg` / `moon.pkg.json` 中的 "
"[`targets`](package.md#conditional-compilation)。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:403
msgid "Source directory"
msgstr "源目录"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:405
msgid "The `source` field is used to specify the source directory of the module."
msgstr "`source` 字段用于指定模块的源目录。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:407
msgid ""
"It must be a relative path to a subdirectory of the directory containing "
"the module file."
msgstr "它必须是相对于模块文件所在目录的子目录路径。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:410
msgid ""
"When creating a module using the `moon new` command, a `src` directory "
"will be automatically generated, and the default value of the `source` "
"field will be `src`."
msgstr "当使用 `moon new` 命令创建一个模块时，将自动生成一个 `src` 目录，并且 `source` 字段的默认值将为 `src`。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:414
msgid "source = \"src\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:419
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"source\": \"src\"\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:427
msgid ""
"When the `source` field does not exist, or its value is an empty string "
"`\"\"`, it is equivalent to setting `source = \".\"`. This means that the"
" source directory is the same as the directory containing the module "
"file."
msgstr ""
"如果 `source` 字段不存在，或其值为空字符串 `\"\"`，则等同于设置 `source = "
"\".\"`。这意味着源目录与模块文件所在目录相同。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:433
msgid "source = \"\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:436
msgid "source = \".\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:441
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"source\": \"\"\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:446
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"source\": \".\"\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:452
msgid "`null` is equivalent to the cases above:"
msgstr "`null` 等同于上述情况："

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:454
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"source\": null\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:461
msgid "Warning List"
msgstr "警告列表"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:463
msgid "This is used to disable specific preset compiler warning numbers."
msgstr "这用于禁用特定的预设编译器警告编号。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:465
msgid ""
"For example, in the following configuration, `-2` disables the warning "
"number 2 (Unused variable)."
msgstr "例如，在以下配置中，`-2` 禁用警告编号 2（未使用的变量）。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:469
msgid "warnings = \"-2\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:474
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"warn-list\": \"-2\"\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:482
msgid ""
"If multiple warnings need to be disabled, they can be directly connected "
"and combined."
msgstr "如果需要禁用多种警告，可以直接连接起来进行组合。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:487
msgid "warnings = \"-2-4\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:492
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"warn-list\": \"-2-4\"\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:500
msgid ""
"If it is necessary to activate certain warnings that were originally "
"prohibited, use the plus sign."
msgstr "如果需要激活某种原来未启用的警告，则使用加号。"

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:504
msgid "warnings = \"+31\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../toolchain/moon/module.md:509
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"warn-list\": \"+31\"\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

